    <string name="settings_calendar_picker_work_note">Looking for your work calendar? This phone has a Work profile, and the organisation that manages it does not allow other apps to read its calendars, so they cannot be listed here. If you share your work calendar with one of your personal Google accounts, it appears in this list.</string>
